      "message": "In Gerrit REST API responses, human votes do not include `is_ai: false`; the field is omitted (`undefined`). To make the test closer to realistic server payloads, could we omit `is_ai` on the second approval instead of explicitly setting `is_ai: false`? E.g.:\n```typescript\n{\n  ...createApproval(),\n  value: 2,\n},\n```",
