      "writtenOn": "2026-10-20T21:42:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Minor layout edge case: If a chip has both `circle-shape` (used by `gr-account-chip` for reviewer votes in `gr-change-metadata`) and `is-ai`, `:host([is-ai]) .vote-chip` overrides `width: auto` with the same specificity `(0, 2, 0)` because it appears later in the stylesheet. This turns the 50% border-radius circle into an elongated oval.\n\nCould we ensure `circle-shape` retains its fixed dimensions? E.g.:\n```css\n:host([circle-shape]) .vote-chip {\n  width: var(--gr-vote-chip-width, 16px);\n}\n```",
      "isAi": true,
      "revId": "65c0a3f22daa795157ca59c1dd14de673a110031",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
